  PRIMARY, both on the SAME 12 creatures
    (a) echo on the taught arm   0.920  against the 0.75 bar      MET
    (b) naming above its null    +0.0174 +- 0.0131 (1.3 SE)   NOT MET

  NOT MET, and the 4th rung is why: naming reads +0.0174 over its own
  null at 1.3 SE, under the 3 SE bar. The echo number above is then
  not evidence of composition -- a surviving echo on a creature that
  learned nothing is just the untaught property, measured twice.
